      "spam": false,
      "value": "The Go on its own is certainly not Powerful enough to Run VRChat but in combination with a PC streaming the contenten in 3d to the Oculus Go and sending the IMU data back to the PC for headmovement and controller movement it would be an Improved Desktop Type mode and an limited VR expirience but in general the Idea is good to get a slight glimps into VRChat in VR even with the limitations of 3DOF im sure just the 3d View alone would be certainly a much better expirience than the Flat Desktop mode. +1 from me even tho i doubt it will happen i would love to see it :)",
